info.description:
Public + Admin API for HotelMS.

Auth: POST /api/admin/auth/login sets an HttpOnly cookie (default name hotel_admin_access). Copy the cookie value into collection variable adminToken, or enable Postman's cookie jar for localhost:5000.

Success envelope: { success: true, data }
Error envelope: { success: false, message, errorCode }

